With the increasing demand for skilled professionals in manufacturing, sales, construction, agri-business, transportation, and healthcare, the School of Business and Industry offers indispensable pathways towards fulfilling career aspirations in the business world. These programs are strategically designed and taught by subject matter experts to provide students with the comprehensive knowledge, practical skills, and hands-on experience necessary to thrive in diverse business environments. Whether aspiring entrepreneurs, managers, or specialists, students in business and industry associate degree programs embark on a journey towards academic excellence and professional success.

